{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西營盤中山紀念公園附近有一架救護車倒車期間，地磚突然下陷。之後救護車被拖走，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上片段可見，救護車的尾轆陷入地磚，無法移動，現場多塊地磚損毀。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.AMBULANCE-0130_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026yoxZrQgOad1787093523.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.AMBULANCE-0130_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">救護車被拖出後，救護員檢視車身，拍下損毀情況。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.AMBULANCE-0130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026GGbOqPFr3G1787093519.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.AMBULANCE-0130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防指昨晚九時許，涉事救護車在中山紀念公園執行救護服務遇到事故，之後當局調派另一架救護車處理。到了凌晨零時，涉事救護車被拖離現場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T23:04:01.241351+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}